{'symbol': 'ABT', 'date': '2022-10-28 05:45:00', 'title': 'ABT SHAREHOLDER ALERT: JAKUBOWITZ LAW REMINDS ABBOTT SHAREHOLDERS OF A LEAD PLAINTIFF DEADLINE OF OCTOBER 31, 2022', 'text': 'NEW YORK, OCT. 28, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0JAKUBOWITZ LAW ANNOUNCES THAT A SECURITIES FRAUD CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT HAS COMMENCED ON BEHALF OF SHAREHOLDERS OF ABBOTT LABORATORIES (NYSE: ABT). TO RECEIVE UPDATES ON THE LAWSUIT, FILL OUT THE FORM: HTTPS://CLAIMYOURLOSS.COM/SECURITIES/ABBOTT-LABORATORIES-LOSS-SUBMISSION-FORM/?ID=33077&FROM=4 THIS LAWSUIT IS ON BEHALF OF ALL PERSONS OR ENTITIES WHO PURCHASED OR OTHERWISE ACQUIRED SHARES OF ABBOTT COMMON STOCK DURING THE PERIOD FROM FEBRUARY 19, 2021, TO JUNE 8, 2022, INCLUSIVE.'}